G. cheṇī , chīṇī f. 'chisel'; Si. sevana 'separation'. — Influenced by verbal forms from MIA.
* chēā̆vaï s.v. chēdayati : S. chevaṇī f. 'potter's cutting
string'; N. chewani 'chisel', H. chewnī f.

